{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:13 2026-10-17 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:13 2026-10-17 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:13 2026-10-17 HKT</p><img alt=\"女事主手纏醫院手帶返回案發現場助查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/9a3485e2c969ba5e6d23f32b83b2e341/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_09_09_24_1_.jpeg\"/><p>土瓜灣永耀街3號一唐樓發生傷人血案。今(17日)早上約7時，一名女住客在三樓一單位聽到敲門聲，開門時遭6男女用硬物襲擊，歹徒闖入單位掠去事主3000元現金及手機，隨後奪門而逃，女事主手腳淌血受傷，警方接報到場，將受傷事主送院救治。據悉，43歲姓郭女事主與歹徒是相識的，相信事件涉及私人糾紛。</p><img alt=\"女事主返回案發現場助查，其後被帶走。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ff9a5abb54bce2874320ddd64d4357e3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_09_09_24.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bf45beaef4d6fc01d6b198fd677f9583/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_09_09_26_1.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1b2104430ae8db8f1a860c6a0055f750/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_09_09_25_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"單位外地面遺下血迹。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3d457d55d51a65882e008ce941dcef78/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_08_50_33.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/92268f332202cb2acd062e1997cd5b3a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_08_50_31.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/222cc7e47ca48ae4115f3e07523c8849/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_08_50_29_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"探員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fdd06e534ea796a9a2bcfa7825d9b6fb/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_08_50_29.jpeg\"/><p>探員調查期間，一名右手戴上醫院手帶、相信是女事主返回案發單位助查，其後被探員帶走。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T01:59:31.331757+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":270,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T01:13:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T03:57:42.435656+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T01:57:37.010056+00:00","content_hash":"49a648fb44432e490fe4c8aee761a5c834f62bf9ed1959b495e8c9a0cb981bcf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}